        // stay playing with the size which is a bit annoying … if i play with them on the reel
        // controller it only seems to work when i spin")
        //
        // Exactly that. These four Auto Layout ports only assigned `_internal`; nothing re-ran the
        // layout, so nothing moved until some OTHER path happened to call _applyAutoLayout — and a
        // spin is one of those paths. Meanwhile centerGrid, fitMode and fitPadding, sitting in the
        // same group, DID call it. Four of seven ports live, three inert, no way to tell which from
        // the outside: you change cellWidth, nothing happens, you change it again, then a spin
        // applies whichever value was last written. That is the "playing with the size" loop.
