// WITHOUT THIS THE COMPONENT IS HANDED `undefined` AND THE WHOLE VIEWER DIES.
// (2026-08-25, export 1787628588143) react-component-node.js passes the node down only
// `if (xgeniaNode.xgeniaNodeAsProp)`. This node never declared it — the only node in the
// repo with a React component that did not — so RenderPaylinesPixiComponent's mount effect
// hit `xgeniaNode.id` on undefined, the ErrorBoundary caught it, and the entire preview was
